OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral held for family who died
OL,4,Ain Shoreham incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA funeral has been held for the family
OL,7,Fof four who died after getting into
OL,8,Fdifficulty in water in Shoreham.
OL,10,FHassan El-Khawas, 55, Zeina Alayn, 37,
OL,11,Fand their daughter Sara, 14, died after
OL,12,Fgetting into difficulty in the water
OL,13,Fnear Shoreham Fort, on 18 August, while
OL,14,Fsix-year-old Saja died in hospital on
OL,15,FFriday, 21 August.
OL,17,FAdnan Hmidan, president of the
OL,18,FPalestinian Forum in Britain (PFB),
OL,19,Fsaid the family's bodies had been
OL,20,Freturned to Lebanon, where they were
OL,21,Flaid to rest in a ceremony at the
OL,22,FRashidieh refugee camp.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,330,320,200,140,0,100
