OL,3,GNEWSAFuneral held for family who died
OL,4,Ain Shoreham incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, Hmidan said the funeral
OL,7,F"took place following prayers at the
OL,8,Fcamp's mosque, after which the victims
OL,9,Fwere laid to rest in the ceremony".
